  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Coarsely grate the carrot and haloumi. Combine the carrot, haloumi and 1 tsp Spanish seasoning in a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2961586/photos/large/158342_1-28d07a76dc0022af21ea6f753dce8715.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Assemble quesadillas: Spread the tortillas with 2 tbs mayonnaise. Divide the haloumi mixture among the tortillas. Fold the tortillas over to enclose the filling.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2961587/photos/large/158342_2-74400e76cb79af4f4000d57104c3ac31.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake quesadillas: Put the quesadillas on the lined tray and lightly spray with olive oil. Bake for 6-8 mins until golden and the cheese is melted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2961588/photos/large/158342_3-d87109b1a26a626c39bc384b5cc9a435.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toast sunflower seeds: Meanwhile, put the sunflower seeds in a cold small frypan over medium heat. Toast, tossing, for 3-4 mins until evenly golden. Remove from the pan and cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2961589/photos/large/158342_4-57690eeb2d47a728baa013b4210857b2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Cut the quesadillas into wedges. Divide the quesadillas and salad leaves among plates. Drizzle the salad leaves with the maple and mustard dressing and scatter over the sunflower seeds. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2961590/photos/large/158342_5-cf10182ce69d7f0cab654e41c9b2f90c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Have some tomato, cucumber or avocado on hand? Chop up and toss with the salad leaves for a nourishing boost.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2961591/photos/large/158342_6-7d1212cef6b76dfaa94cb5058f9755f8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
